                <head>Mr. Dillet to Mr. Kirkpatrick.</head>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Sir</hi>. A ship mail was despatched yesterday
                    for Liverpool by the steamship Confed erate States.</p>
                <p>Yours, truly,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>STEPHEN DILLET.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Thomas Kirkpatrick</hi>.</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
